TEXT 264 -112 Left 2 !* Actividad I Dos capacitores con resistencia y switch\n* Q1(0)=1uC on C1, Q2(0)=0 on C2, R=1k\n* C1=1uF and C1=10uF are stepped. C2=1uF fixed.\n \n.param Q0=1u\n.param R=1k\n.param C2=1u\n \n.step param C1 list 1u 10u\n \n* C1 carga inicial -V_C1(0)=Q0/C1\nC1 a 0 {C1} IC={Q0/C1}\n \n* C2 initially discharged\nC2 b c {C2} IC=0\n \n* Resistor from C2 bottom node c to ground (C1 bottom node)\nR1 c 0 {R}\n \n* Switch closes at t=0. Before that it is open.\nS1 a b ctrl 0 SW\nVctrl ctrl 0 PULSE(0 1 0 1n 1n 10 20)\n.model SW SW(Ron=1m Roff=1G Vt=0.5 Vh=0)\n \n* Initial condition for node c\n.ic V(c)=0\n \n* Transient simulation. uic uses capacitor IC values.\n.tran 0 10m 0 1u uic\n \n.save V(a) V(b) V(c) I(R1)\n \n.end\n \nQ1 = C1*V(a)\nQ2 = C2*(V(b)-V(c))\nI  = I(R1)
